# Route: guide 31 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 48 to 50, 28
# quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Hinterlands, Westfall, Darnassus, Azshara): Aerie Peak ->
# Hiri'watha -> Quel'Danil Lodge -> Agol'watha -> Skulk Rock -> The Overlook
# Cliffs -> Hiri'watha -> Aerie Peak -> Hiri'watha -> The Altar of Zul ->
# Aerie Peak -> The Overlook Cliffs -> Agol'watha -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Prayer to Elune (3378; Twilight
# Dark Shaman 47-48, Twilight Fire Guard 48-49, Twilight Geomancer 49-50,
# Twilight Idolater 49-51).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5141
# Dragonscale Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Jammal'an the Prophet (1446), The Defias Brotherhood
# (166), The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Unsent Letter (373), In Search of
# Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199).

